    <briefdescription>
<para>Standard Black-Karasinski model class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements the standard Black-Karasinski model defined by <formula id="292">\[ d\ln r_t = (\theta(t) - \alpha \ln r_t)dt + \sigma dW_t, \]</formula> where <formula id="139">$ alpha $</formula> and <formula id="140">$ sigma $</formula> are constants. </para>    </detaileddescription>
